The J73 coordinate convention and mathematical formulas follow the existing
MIT-licensed J73 verification sources and Task 54 design/prototype. This
implementation imports none of those mathematical producer/checker modules.
Task 65 also ports the contact-facet and astra-intersection mathematical
identities from Task 45 certificate.py and the Task 63 extension specification;
all arithmetic is evaluated by this checker's own exact and polynomial modules.

